{% import '/components/layout'; import '/components/button' %}
<X:Layout title="Alapa" required checked>
  <div
  style="
  text-align: center;
  padding: 20px 20px;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a, #1e293b);
  color: white;
  min-height: 100vh;
  "
  >
  <!-- Header -->
  <h2 style="font-size: 3em; margin-bottom: 5px;">
    Welcome to Alapa 🚀
  </h2>

  <p style="font-size: 1.3em; opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 5px;">
    Build fast. Think faster.
  </p>

  <p style="font-size: 1.1em; color: #38bdf8; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    ⚡ 10x faster than love
  </p>

  <!-- Cheeky Law Card -->
  <div
  style="
  max-width: 700px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 30px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  "
  >
  <h2 style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
    Law of Romantic Gravitation (Unofficial 😏)
  </h2>

  <p style="font-size: 1.05em; margin-bottom: 15px; opacity: 0.85;">
    The force of attraction between two consenting adults is directly proportional
    to the product of their ages, and inversely proportional to both their
    distance apart and their resistance to temptation. Focus on code to keep the system stable.
  </p>

  <p style="font-size: 0.95em; opacity: 0.6; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    In high-pressure developer environments, distractions reduce efficiency. The stronger the focus, the faster the build.
  </p>

  <!-- MathML Formula -->
  <div style="font-size: 1.8em; margin: 20px 0;">
    <math display="block">
      <mi>F</mi>
      <mo>=</mo>
      <mi>k</mi>
      <mo>·</mo>
      <mfrac>
        <mrow>
          <mi>M</mi><mi>a</mi>
          <mo>×</mo>
          <mi>F</mi><mi>a</mi>
        </mrow>
        <mrow>
          <mi>D</mi>
          <mo>×</mo>
          <mi>T</mi>
        </mrow>
      </mfrac>
    </math>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: left; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.9em; opacity: 0.75;">
    <p><strong>F</strong> = Force of attraction 😏</p>
    <p><strong>Ma</strong> = Man's Age</p>
    <p><strong>Fa</strong> = Woman's Age</p>
    <p><strong>D</strong> = Distance apart</p>
    <p><strong>T</strong> = Temptation resistance (focus, discipline, deadlines)</p>
    <p><strong>k</strong> = Vibes constant (unstable in production)</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Dev Joke Footer -->
  <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 0.85em; opacity: 0.5;">
    ⚠️ Warning: At D → 0 and T → 0, system behavior becomes unpredictable.
  </p>

  <p style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.85em; opacity: 0.5;">
    Recommended: Increase T (focus on code) to maintain maximum efficiency.
  </p>
</div>

<!-- Fake CLI & Benchmark Fun -->
<div style="margin-top: 40px; font-family: monospace; opacity: 0.8;">
  <p>$ alapa init my-app</p>
  <p style="opacity: 0.6;">✔ Project created in 0.3ms</p>
  <p style="opacity: 0.4;">✔ Distractions minimized</p>

  <p style="margin-top: 20px;">$ alapa build --no-distractions</p>
  <p style="opacity: 0.6;">✔ Build completed in 0.7ms</p>
  <p style="opacity: 0.5;">✔ Focus level: 100%</p>

  <p style="margin-top: 20px; color: #38bdf8;">⚡ Handles 1M requests/sec, 0 emotional baggage/sec</p>
</div>

<!-- CTA -->
<div style="margin-top: 50px;">
  <a target="doc" href="https://alapa.dev/docs">
    <X:Button>Read the Docs</X:Button>
  </a>
</div>
</div>
</X:Layout>